# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — aios-kit
#
# The repo carries the BRAIN: manual, context, skills, knowledge.
# It never carries deliverables, binaries, or secrets.
# A 2 GB repo is unusable from a phone or a cloud session.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
.claude.json
*token*.json
*secret*
*.oat

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
dist/
build/

# Heavy deliverables — these live in your drive, not in git
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.mp4
*.mov
*.zip

# Comentarios scrapeados: traen nombres de personas reales y el repo es público
projects/redes-amazon-gas/analisis-comentarios/data/

# Assets de producción de los posts (fotos, clips, audio, fuentes): pesan cientos de MB y viven en el disco
# y en el drive. Del post se commitea el texto: guion, brief, scripts, HTML y copies.
projects/**/*.png
projects/**/*.jpg
projects/**/*.jpeg
projects/**/*.webp
projects/**/*.heic
projects/**/*.mp3
projects/**/*.wav
projects/**/*.ttf
projects/**/*.otf
projects/**/node_modules/
projects/**/.hyperframes/artifacts/
*.log
